<http://chem.deri.ie/granatum#Disease> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#comment_values_json> "[\"A Disease is any abnormal condition of the body or mind that causes discomfort, dysfunction, or distress to the person affected or those in contact with the person. The term is often used broadly to include injuries, disabilities, syndromes, symptoms, deviant behaviors, and atypical variations of structure and function.\"]" .
