<http://opendata.inra.fr/AHOL/AHOL_0005001> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#publication_review_comment_proposed> "The definition reads like three different definitions copied without reconciliation. \"Damage on health\" is very broad and encompasses entities like suffocation which is not a disease. \"The modifications of an organism defending itself against an infection or other damager (!) factor\" does exclude a lot of entities typically denoted as diseases. There could be a potential malignancy against which is no observable sign of defence. \"Perturbation of the animal's normal function\" is again very broad. Disease is_a animal health trait is_a animal health trait ontology for livestock seems like non-adherence to class hierarchy modelling principles. Included with the caveat of the animal only scope of the ontology." .
<http://opendata.inra.fr/AHOL/AHOL_0005001> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#reality_vs_classification> "biological_state" .
<http://opendata.inra.fr/AHOL/AHOL_0005001> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#retrieved_at_by_database> "BioPortal: 2026-06-29T20:09:52-04:00; BioPortal: 2026-06-29T20:11:06-04:00" .
<http://opendata.inra.fr/AHOL/AHOL_0005001> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#review_comment> "The definition reads like three different definitions copy pasted. \"Damage on health\" is very broad and encompasses entities like suffocation which is clearly not a disease. \"The modifications of an organism defending itself against an infection or other damager (!) factor\" does exclude a lot of entities typically denoted as diseases. There could be a potential malignancy against which is no observable sign of defence. \"Perturbation of the animal's normal function\" is again very broad. Holding my breath can be argued as a perturbation of normal function. disease is_a animal health trait is_a animal health trait ontology for livestock seems like non-adherence to class hierarchy modelling principles.  |  Included with the caveat of the animal only scope of the ontology." .
<http://opendata.inra.fr/AHOL/AHOL_0005001> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#review_date> "2026-07-04" .
