<http://purl.jp/bio/4/id/201606017936711318> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#review_comment> "Disease has as sibling diffuse_disease and endocrine_disease, dislocation and drowning as well as injury (disease). The superclass is Disease, and Symptom. Taken together, this seems like a term collection rather than a real commitment to ontological principles." .
