<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000102> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#definition_values_json> "[\"A part of an organism that has undergone a change in structural integrity and has a higher chance of dysfunction or causing dysfunction in another structure.; A disorder that involves some structural damage that is immediately caused by a catastrophic external force.\"]" .
