<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMIT_0005457> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#publication_review_comment_proposed> "Missing definition; missing comment. The hierarchy of omit:Disease is_a omit:Pathologic process is_a omit:Pathological Conditions, Signs and Symptoms is_a omit:Diseases Category is_a omit:Mesh_term is_a bfo:quality is internally inconsistent. This ontology is built on bfo, but a disease cannot be a bfo:quality and a process cannot be a bfo:quality." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMIT_0005457> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#reality_vs_classification> "biological_state" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMIT_0005457> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#retrieved_at_by_database> "BioPortal: 2026-06-29T20:06:55-04:00" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMIT_0005457> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#review_comment> "missing definition; missing comment. Very strange hierachy of omit:Disease is_a omit:Pathologic process is_a omit:Pathological Conditions, Signs and Symptoms is_a omit:Diseases Category is_a omit:Mesh_term is_a bfo:quality. Clearly, this ontology is built on bfo, but a disease can't be a bfo:quality and a process can't be a bfo:quality." .
