<http://www.limics.fr/ontologies/ontolurgences#EtatPathologique> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#review_comment> "Preferred label suggests pathological state, but the definition and hidden label define a diagnostic synthesis: clinical history/examination plus paraclinical evidence. This routes the class through diagnostic/information content rather than modelling pathological state itself. Superclass EtatInterne/Menelas hierarchy remains conceptually problematic." .
