<http://www.limics.fr/ontologies/ontopsychiasoc#Trouble> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#review_comment> "Very narrow scope of ontopsychiasoc:disorder is_a ontopsychiasoc:concept linked to behaviour that has ontopsychiasoc:behavioural disorder as a subclass. Still, this ontology is built on Menelas top. Thus, disorder is a state and thus an intentional object in Kantain philosophical perception. But that imports the menelas top contradiction of menelastop:intentional object is_a menelastop:abstract object." .
