<http://www.semanticweb.org//Childbearing-ageWomenwithEpilepsyOntology#OWLClassde18b6e3_5aab_4eba_937e_3c256c84cdb6> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#review_comment> "missing definition; missing comment, but almost clear BFO legacy even without explicit reference to bfo classes. The authors modelled disease as a dependent continuant and not as disposition which does not entail realizabilty. Thus, the conflict of the disposition model with how disease is perceived clinically as a realised (!) not realizable entity is not sparked here." .
