<http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/chronic-diease-patient-education-ontology#Disease> <urn:uuid:8f96cf34-53c2-48d2-88c5-96d07704fcf7#publication_review_comment_proposed> "No comment, definition or superclass. No paper. The ontology description says: \"The constructed ontology mainly consists of two levels. Level 1 includes 5 terms: demographic, disease, vital sign, lifestyle and medication, which describe the characteristics contained in the patient data, as well as the topics of education materials. Leve 2 contains the detailed elements for each Level 1 class.\". Although denoted ontology no object property is in use." .
